{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06934","headline":"渔浦 · 常建","name":"渔浦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春至百草绿，陂泽闻鶬鶊。\n别家投钓翁，今世沧浪情。\n沤紵爲緼袍，折麻爲长缨。\n荣誉失本真，怪人浮此生。\n碧水月自阔，安流净而平。\n扁舟与天际，独往谁能名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}